ef 17592186521819} {:answer/id #uuid "9655312b-299c-5150-92fb-924ba2114fd9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521825}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521819} :answer-field/id #uuid "e41e89b0-8613-5944-9948-dba717ba611f" :answer-field/key "$(0,12)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521860}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "10aa9a22-24d9-5578-9f7c-cc0b57f6bc72" :question/problem "At which points on the curve $8 x y + 2 y^{2}=16 x^{2} + 432$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "First, we bring all variables to one side:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}8 x y + 2 y^{2}&=16 x^{2} + 432\\\\- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 2 y^{2} - 432&=0\\end{aligned}$$\n\nIf we set $f(x,y)=- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 2 y^{2} - 432$, our curve can be viewed as the level curve $f(x,y)=0.$\n\nA tangent vector to the level curve can be computed as follows:\n\n$$t(x,y)=f_y(x,y)\\,i-f_x(x,y)\\,j$$\n\nSo, we calculate $t(x,y):$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)&=\\frac{∂}{∂y}(- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 2 y^{2} - 432)\\,i-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 2 y^{2} - 432)\\,j\\\\&=(8 x + 4 y)\\,i-(- 32 x + 8 y)\\,j\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSince our tangent vector needs to be perpendicular to $j$, we must have $t\\cdot j=0.$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)\\cdot j&=0\\\\32 x - 8 y&=0\\\\y&=4x\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSubstituting $y=4x$ into the equation of our curve gives:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}2(4x)^{2}+8x(4x)-16x^{2}-432&=0\\\\48x^{2}-432&=0\\\\x^{2}&=9\\\\x&=\\pm 3\\end{aligned}$$\n\nFinally, the corresponding points are $(3,12)$ and $(-3,-12)$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521761 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a67e1549-d894-58c3-ab0c-c5878c485999" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521835} {:answer/id #uuid "ee1f00c6-1b40-51e8-8084-53cf529cfa21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521867}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521867} :answer-field/id #uuid "15959162-8202-56a1-a0f2-83319529d308" :answer-field/key "$(\\frac{1}{2},2)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521763} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1582ef11-2a8f-56b8-be1e-533ad686623d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521762} {:answer/id #uuid "4d90e1ca-3cff-5a39-9cbc-7a04878d8001" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521796}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521796} :answer-field/id #uuid "4bf2940c-8256-52c6-be97-fc5e2aae3edc" :answer-field/key "$(0,2)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521793} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "806a4800-e105-55cd-86c2-f0de72c7a66b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521820} {:answer/id #uuid "acf0d49c-0802-5936-9cc5-c8634c61903c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521840}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521840} :answer-field/id #uuid "7754cae4-0b72-5eed-ba00-86faee75c95a" :answer-field/key "$(1,0)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521817} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4480175c-3691-5b32-9497-8234cd5473d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521790} {:answer/id #uuid "edb2237f-9c3e-58da-8879-ad909ca56f97" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521866}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521866} :answer-field/id #uuid "9f42b424-e100-5b5c-951d-e8888fc4bf5f" :answer-field/key "$(-1,-2)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521828} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "09e4bcaf-692e-58c5-9fd3-61415f2310de" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521753} {:answer/id #uuid "113382ea-65ed-55c1-ac18-b7478229c5ab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521759}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521753} :answer-field/id #uuid "c37932de-0cce-59c6-b24c-876d74561656" :answer-field/key "$(1,1)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521848} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b0fcc2f-e79a-53cd-94ba-19c374993156" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521767} {:answer/id #uuid "5bb26662-eec4-5532-b2af-772b585f772c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521804}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521804} :answer-field/id #uuid "dee6063a-ddce-52a8-86a7-f5e0d850c4d5" :answer-field/key "$(1,2)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521859}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "138b2fa1-5696-5cfb-b4c1-4b8eecec9f34" :question/problem "At which points on the curve $4 x y + y^{2}=4 x^{2} + 8$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "First, we bring all variables to one side:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}4 x y + y^{2}&=4 x^{2} + 8\\\\- 4 x^{2} + 4 x y + y^{2} - 8&=0\\end{aligned}$$\n\nIf we set $f(x,y)=- 4 x^{2} + 4 x y + y^{2} - 8$, our curve can be viewed as the level curve $f(x,y)=0.$\n\nA tangent vector to the level curve can be computed as follows:\n\n$$t(x,y)=f_y(x,y)\\,i-f_x(x,y)\\,j$$\n\nSo, we calculate $t(x,y):$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)&=\\frac{∂}{∂y}(- 4 x^{2} + 4 x y + y^{2} - 8)\\,i-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(- 4 x^{2} + 4 x y + y^{2} - 8)\\,j\\\\&=(4 x + 2 y)\\,i-(- 8 x + 4 y)\\,j\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSince our tangent vector needs to be perpendicular to $j$, we must have $t\\cdot j=0.$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)\\cdot j&=0\\\\8 x - 4 y&=0\\\\y&=2x\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSubstituting $y=2x$ into the equation of our curve gives:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}1(2x)^{2}+4x(2x)-4x^{2}-8&=0\\\\8x^{2}-8&=0\\\\x^{2}&=1\\\\x&=\\pm 1\\end{aligned}$$\n\nFinally, the corresponding points are $(1,2)$ and $(-1,-2)$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521800 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "306ad61b-7cf2-5e46-b92a-99bb59b27116" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521779} {:answer/id #uuid "a5d14569-99f9-5f0a-b34b-fcf4aef8d5b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521833}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521779} :answer-field/id #uuid "2bf8aaf8-fe3e-5ed9-9824-d9ba6d421a9e" :answer-field/key "$(0,16)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521776} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04f0e009-6fcf-56c0-ab31-f7119fd2b704" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521748} {:answer/id #uuid "bc7dfc78-e18a-5790-b5c3-ca2284d7c7cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521845}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521748} :answer-field/id #uuid "2cc7bde4-9ea5-57bc-8ce3-0de4156021db" :answer-field/key "$(4,16)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521778} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bd4b8f5d-5057-5789-b7f7-4fd4c164a788" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521846} {:answer/id #uuid "ff204a0b-f70b-54b9-9f82-42d7e94798fc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521875}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521846} :answer-field/id #uuid "d22532c8-639b-5317-9e25-5a6b015f3e59" :answer-field/key "$(-4,-16)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521854} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a3c48b5-42fb-5379-947d-53eddffd3f43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521765} {:answer/id #uuid "5594ceac-94ff-581e-9891-b704648df3b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521802}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521802} :answer-field/id #uuid "d31c957d-5744-57ef-a8b5-ba4c001a3589" :answer-field/key "$(4,8)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521856} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a87d580a-cc87-57ae-a1c2-a6fb03cd6656" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521836} {:answer/id #uuid "e47c93e5-ac5e-5cd9-8ce7-1409ae6e9efc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521862}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521862} :answer-field/id #uuid "e42052b3-aa02-5893-8463-3d339c71e909" :answer-field/key "$(2,16)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521861} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "47875e80-b080-5ec4-a93d-445fc72ad0bf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521791} {:answer/id #uuid "c9b55f41-a1e5-5298-bc1c-4923b387c0d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521852}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521852} :answer-field/id #uuid "f1266a7c-b2e9-54bd-aeaa-5ab051911a08" :answer-field/key "$(4,0)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521872}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "5284e034-941a-5de0-a7ad-3718d5b22f4c" :question/problem "At which points on the curve $8 x y + 3 y^{2}=16 x^{2} + 1024$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "First, we bring all variables to one side:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}8 x y + 3 y^{2}&=16 x^{2} + 1024\\\\- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 3 y^{2} - 1024&=0\\end{aligned}$$\n\nIf we set $f(x,y)=- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 3 y^{2} - 1024$, our curve can be viewed as the level curve $f(x,y)=0.$\n\nA tangent vector to the level curve can be computed as follows:\n\n$$t(x,y)=f_y(x,y)\\,i-f_x(x,y)\\,j$$\n\nSo, we calculate $t(x,y):$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)&=\\frac{∂}{∂y}(- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 3 y^{2} - 1024)\\,i-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 3 y^{2} - 1024)\\,j\\\\&=(8 x + 6 y)\\,i-(- 32 x + 8 y)\\,j\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSince our tangent vector needs to be perpendicular to $j$, we must have $t\\cdot j=0.$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)\\cdot j&=0\\\\32 x - 8 y&=0\\\\y&=4x\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSubstituting $y=4x$ into the equation of our curve gives:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}3(4x)^{2}+8x(4x)-16x^{2}-1024&=0\\\\64x^{2}-1024&=0\\\\x^{2}&=16\\\\x&=\\pm 4\\end{aligned}$$\n\nFinally, the corresponding points are $(4,16)$ and $(-4,-16)$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521807 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9a081b4b-d2c2-54f6-ab72-e97e24330f29" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521827} {:answer/id #uuid "f122121f-13ed-5d40-84a7-05ee73afda8c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521871}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521871} :answer-field/id #uuid "31f0b4d9-85ff-5f7b-a017-2aaa76c4d97a" :answer-field/key "$(\\frac{1}{2},4)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/r